# Citation

If {{ project.name }} is used in work that is published, say here how it should be
cited.

!!! warning "Fill this in before publishing"
    `docs-studio` does not invent citations. Add the real entry below — authors, title,
    venue, year — and nothing that is not settled. A DOI or an arXiv identifier belongs
    here only once it exists.

```bibtex
@software{example_key,
  author = {{ '{' }}{{ project.author }}{{ '}' }},
  title  = {{ '{' }}{{ project.name }}{{ '}' }},
  year   = {20XX},
  url    = {{ '{' }}{{ project.repo_url or project.site_url }}{{ '}' }}
}
```
